      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12372505/comment/12508551",
          "id": "12508551",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ckiehl",
            "name": "ckiehl",
            "key": "ckiehl",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Christoph Kiehl",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "This patch modifies LazyQueryResultImpl to provide a setter-method for resultFetchSize. I also fixed the class which is used for the Logger and optimized LazyScoreNodeIterator.skip() to only fetch more results if necessary.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ckiehl",
            "name": "ckiehl",
            "key": "ckiehl",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Christoph Kiehl",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2007-06-27T14:03:18.552+0000",
          "updated": "2007-06-27T14:03:18.552+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12372505/comment/12508867",
          "id": "12508867",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ckiehl",
            "name": "ckiehl",
            "key": "ckiehl",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Christoph Kiehl",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "This patch modifies the previous patch to fix a small bug which caused LazyQueryResultImpl.getResults(int) to be called on each successive call to LazyQueryResultImpl.getNodeIterator()",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=ckiehl",
            "name": "ckiehl",
            "key": "ckiehl",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Christoph Kiehl",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2007-06-28T16:37:41.999+0000",
          "updated": "2007-06-28T16:37:41.999+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12372505/comment/12509104",
          "id": "12509104",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
            "name": "mreutegg",
            "key": "mreutegg",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658"
            },
            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "Thank you for the patch.\n\nWouldn't it be more intuitive to set the resultFetchSize on the Query instance instead of the QueryResult? With your current patch one will call:\n\nQueryManager qm = ...\nQuery q = qm.createQuery(myQuery, Query.XPath);\nQueryResult result = q.execute();\n((LazyQueryResultImpl) result).setResultFetchSize(10);\nNodeIterator nodes = result.getNodes();\n...\n\nI think the following is more intuitive:\n\nQueryManager qm = ...\nQuery q = qm.createQuery(myQuery, Query.XPath);\n((QueryImpl) query).setResultFetchSize(10);\nQueryResult result = q.execute();\nNodeIterator nodes = result.getNodes();\n...",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
            "name": "mreutegg",
            "key": "mreutegg",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=mreutegg&avatarId=18658"
            },
            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "created": "2007-06-29T13:16:18.996+0000",
          "updated": "2007-06-29T13:16:18.996+0000"
        },
        {
